<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-11-26T22:28:49.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIL carried out a suicide attack in Hasakah that killed two Syrian security force members and injured several others, and a separate suicide bombing in Tartous wounded a security officer and killed the gunman. The Syrian government is considering a law to grant nationality to children of foreign fighters, reflecting concerns about the legacy of extremist participation. Qatar, Saudi Arabia and Jordan issued condemnations of attacks on Syrian security facilities, showing regional diplomatic responses. Syrian authorities seized Iranian weapons destined for Lebanon, indicating ongoing arms interdiction efforts. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/world/unhcr-global-appeal-2027&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/world/mixed-migration-review-2026-migration-age-polycrisis&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/world/legal-identity-displaced-people-west-and-central-africa-reform-effective-access-turning-political-commitment-protection-outcomes&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/syrian-arab-republic/unhcr-syria-operational-update-october-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zZWhzX3JnN0lod3RuWVhhSzZqRlZ5U2ttWEl2b0UtSzV0QVNjWGMzMVFsbzEtOTFYQjdxNG1EVmpvRVFRNDk1TlEtOEw0S0R4ZU1IMGZ0ck15MU55c1ZqakFvazFJdTlZSURpdmNUWnlwemFVY3BIMkpweXh3WnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOeTd4b2lBcVEtUDcyRnYzMlFrSU1RRHgxY01ZX29QeVplRk14ZFdEWlJQdXVKUVY4emd1azNfdmJwR1dFVy1lcDd3eFJrbU01OE02eHhoaWJCckl0UnFZZUFwX2VyeWl6d2JQeHR3TkJFMnQtSm1zN20wbXJNdThDR1FIQWkzMUZyV2hJVUMtUVBtZ